  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 7.351351351351352,
      "text": "The best day with BUY HARD is a day you barely think about purchasing. The everyday"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.351351351351352,
      "end": 13.324324324324325,
      "text": "supplies are being looked after, and you’re busy running the business. Then something"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.324324324324325,
      "end": 17,
      "text": "happens that no forecast could have seen coming."
    },
    {
      "start": 17,
      "end": 23.588235294117645,
      "text": "A piano lands on our shipment. Cups, bread—the whole delivery is ruined. Unlikely? Sure."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.588235294117645,
      "end": 30.647058823529413,
      "text": "But a damaged shipment, right before you need it? That happens. And the customers are"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.647058823529413,
      "end": 33,
      "text": "still going to show up."
    },
    {
      "start": 33,
      "end": 41.65384615384615,
      "text": "I know where to get enough to keep us going. So I tell my buyer: ‘The shipment’s ruined."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.65384615384615,
      "end": 48.38461538461539,
      "text": "I’m picking up emergency supplies for the next few days. Please arrange replacement cups"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.38461538461539,
      "end": 56.07692307692308,
      "text": "and bread as quickly as possible. The cups can come from the online store. Our bakery"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.07692307692308,
      "end": 58,
      "text": "takes orders by email.’"
    },
    {
      "start": 58,
      "end": 64.97435897435898,
      "text": "The buyer takes it from there. For the cups, it checks the right product, the quantity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.97435897435898,
      "end": 71.51282051282051,
      "text": "and the quickest delivery available from the online store. It gets the purchase ready for"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.51282051282051,
      "end": 75,
      "text": "approval while I’m out handling the immediate problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 75,
      "end": 83.6268656716418,
      "text": "The bread takes a different route. Our bakery works by email, so the buyer writes to them"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.6268656716418,
      "end": 92.76119402985074,
      "text": "with what we need and asks how soon they can deliver. They reply with a price, but haven’t"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.76119402985074,
      "end": 100.3731343283582,
      "text": "confirmed the delivery time. The buyer follows up, gets that detail, and puts the answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.3731343283582,
      "end": 108.49253731343283,
      "text": "together. I haven’t had to call the bakery, chase the reply, or copy anything into a"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.49253731343283,
      "end": 109,
      "text": "spreadsheet."
    },
    {
      "start": 109,
      "end": 116.43478260869566,
      "text": "What comes back to me is a plan for both: the cups, the bread, what each will cost, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.43478260869566,
      "end": 123.47826086956522,
      "text": "when each can arrive. If one leaves us short, I need to know. Otherwise, I can review the"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.47826086956522,
      "end": 127,
      "text": "terms and let the buyer get on with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 127,
      "end": 134.90697674418604,
      "text": "Once I approve, the buyer places the cup order online and sends the bread order to the"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.90697674418604,
      "end": 141.41860465116278,
      "text": "bakery. It checks the store’s order confirmation and the bakery’s email reply against what"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.41860465116278,
      "end": 147,
      "text": "we agreed. If either comes back different, that still needs sorting out."
    },
    {
      "start": 147,
      "end": 154.36666666666667,
      "text": "And if something changes, I tell the same buyer: ‘The bread needs to go to our other"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.36666666666667,
      "end": 160,
      "text": "location.’ It already has the order and the bakery conversation to work from."
    },
    {
      "start": 160,
      "end": 166,
      "text": "I handled those emergency supplies and got back to our customers. Meanwhile, the buyer"
    },
    {
      "start": 166,
      "end": 172,
      "text": "took care of the replacement orders. That’s the relationship I’m building with BUY HARD."
    },
    {
      "start": 172,
      "end": 180,
      "text": "You handle the business. Your buyer handles the buying. Purchasing. Handled."
    }
  ]
}
